> Custom coordinates jewelry and personalized engraved keepsakes, made to order in the USA. Necklaces, bracelets, rings, keychains, star maps, and matching sets engraved with your meaningful latitude and longitude.

OurCoordinates is a family-owned online jewelry store based in Saint Petersburg, Florida that specializes in laser-engraved jewelry. Our flagship products are Custom Coordinates Jewelry—necklaces, bracelets, rings, keychains, and matching sets engraved with the exact latitude and longitude of any meaningful place anywhere on earth, with an interactive map and live engraving preview directly on each product page.

## Key Facts & Policies

- **Made to Order:** Engraved to order in the USA (Saint Petersburg, FL)
- **Production & Shipping Time:** Personalized pieces ship in 7–10 business days, plus carrier transit time
- **Free Shipping:** Free US shipping on orders over $50
- **Christmas 2026 Cutoff:** Order by December 7, 2026 for Christmas delivery
- **Engraving Preview:** Interactive map coordinate finder and live engraving preview directly on each product page before checkout
- **Guarantee & Returns:** Free remake within 30 days on any engraving error or quality defect. Personalized pieces are final sale; non-personalized items can be returned unworn within 30 days.
- **Contact:** info@ourcoordinates.com (responses within 24 hours)

